# Era 1, The Exchange: Abel and Bet. The marriage as a transaction in the Furrowe parlour; what Bet knows, told to
# Edie at the fitting (Ilo never hears it); the wedding, a pleasure before Osby. Story lead, deepening pass,
# 2026-10-23. DRAFT: every line waits for the author's line approval (ledger row S14). The marriage is fixed by
# canon (era1.md section 3); the scene varies, and Abel's choice here moves only what is said about the rent.

